  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Tienes un momento? Mira, es que soy\nperfumista y necesito ayuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005400690065006E0065007300200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F003F0020004D006900720061002C002000650073002000710075006500200073006F0079000A00700065007200660075006D0069007300740061002000790020006E006500630065007300690074006F002000610079007500640061002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy trabajando en un perfume a partir\nde las fragancias que emana Spritzee.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dependiendo de lo que coman, los Spritzee\ngeneran distintas fragancias.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Para este perfume, necesito que Spritzee coma\nmuchas bayas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000610072006100200065007300740065002000700065007200660075006D0065002C0020006E006500630065007300690074006F0020007100750065002000530070007200690074007A0065006500200063006F006D0061000A006D007500630068006100730020006200610079006100730021001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Para ser precisa, necesito 20 Bayas Zreza,\n5 Bayas Tamate y 5 Bayas Caoca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Spri?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0053007000720069003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La cosa es que tengo un problema.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200063006F007300610020006500730020007100750065002000740065006E0067006F00200075006E002000700072006F0062006C0065006D0061002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hay tantos olores distintos por la ciudad que,\nsi me dedicase a recorrer las calles en busca de<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlas bayas, se reduciría la sensibilidad de mi nariz.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 156
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que ¿te importaría ir a buscar las bayas\npor mí?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300ED0020007100750065002000BF0074006500200069006D0070006F007200740061007200ED00610020006900720020006100200062007500730063006100720020006C00610073002000620061007900610073000A0070006F00720020006D00ED003F001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Podrías recogerlas por la ciudad, o incluso\ncomprarlas en los puestos de por ahí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Necesito 20 Bayas Zreza, 5 Bayas Tamate\ny 5 Bayas Caoca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006500630065007300690074006F0020003200300020004200610079006100730020005A00720065007A0061002C00200035002000420061007900610073002000540061006D006100740065000A007900200035002000420061007900610073002000430061006F00630061002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Tzee?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0054007A00650065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te recuerdo que necesito 20 Bayas Zreza, 5 Bayas\nTamate y 5 Bayas Caoca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me has traído todas las bayas que necesitaba!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D00650020006800610073002000740072006100ED0064006F00200074006F0064006100730020006C0061007300200062006100790061007300200071007500650020006E0065006300650073006900740061006200610021001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con tantas bayas seguro que genera\nuna fragancia muy compleja e interesante.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Las bayas que me has traído son todas picantes,\nasí que estaba pensando crear una fragancia<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncon toques especiados.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Spriii!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530070007200690069006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué ocurre, Spritzee? Con lo bien que te portas\nsiempre, no entiendo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ah! ¿Son demasiadas bayas para tomar de golpe?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100680021002000BF0053006F006E002000640065006D00610073006900610064006100730020006200610079006100730020007000610072006100200074006F006D0061007200200064006500200067006F006C00700065003F001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Spri!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300700072006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿No tienes curiosidad por ver qué nuevas\nfragancias es capaz de generar tu cuerpo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tzee!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10054007A0065006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya veo... Tengo que encontrar una manera\nde que absorbas esas bayas sin empacharte.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ojalá aún existiera La Zumoteca...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006A0061006C00E10020006100FA006E00200065007800690073007400690065007200610020004C00610020005A0075006D006F0074006500630061002E002E002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si pudiéramos encontrar a alguno de los antiguos\nempleados, ¡nos podrían hacer Zumo Rojo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncon las Bayas Zreza para que se lo tome Spritzee!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Spriii!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530070007200690069006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias a ti he descubierto nuevas posibilidades\nen el mundo de la perfumería!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nComo agradecimiento, me gustaría darte estas\nMentas Modestas y un Caramelo Experiencia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 175
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tzeeeee!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10054007A0065006500650065006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias a ti he descubierto nuevas posibilidades\nen el mundo de la perfumería!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEspero que sirva para entrenar la nariz\nde mi aprendiz Ophélie.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
